Overview
========

"she_test_vectors" directory contains test vector(TV) files for SHE.

- SHE Test Vector files have .shx extension.
- Any file other than .shx extension will not be executed by SHE.
- TV will be executed in alphabetical order.


Current directory structure of she_test_vectors is:
--------------------------------------------------
she_test_vectors:
	- common : contain test vectors for API common for both seco and v2x
	- README
	- v2x : contain test vectors for API specific to v2x
	- seco : (will be added later for seco specific API test vectors)

common:
	- add_keys
	- cipher
	- create_keystore
	- mac_generate
	- mac_verify
	- mac_verify_bit_ext
	- plain_key
	- rng
	- rng_uninited
	- status

v2x:
	- mac_generate
	- mac_verify
	- mac_verify_bit_ext

We have created separate files in most of the directories for
	- opening all required session and services and
	- closing the session and services

With this modular approach we dont need to complex our TV files with session
open and close commands and can keep the TV files specific to the test case.

We can keep session commands in same TV file also.

Test Vector Execution:
---------------------
Two options are provided for executing the TVs:
	- by giving TV file name e.g.
		v2x_she_test file1.shx file2.shx

	- Execute all TVs in one go e.g.
		v2x_she_test
